extends layout

block content
  h3 Hi #{name},

  p We received a request to reset your password for your Yifu account.

  p Your One-Time Password (OTP) is:

  h2(style="letter-spacing: 3px; color: #2E86C1; margin: 20px 0;")
    | #{otp}

  p This OTP will expire in #{expiryTime} minutes.

  p If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure.

  p For security reasons, do not share this OTP with anyone.

  p Thanks,
  p Team Yifu
